{"posts":[{"id":"bsz_p3_51","t":"This one is developing...","a":"GGJJ","d":"08 Mar 2017 21:50","r":"Trader","n":"#51","p":3,"im":["4d4604fe7317a74f571ecddc48a3289100a714ce","823239350a80f8df918ff4f94060c282f4c970dc"],"fa":"این یکی دارد شکل می‌گیرد…","ib":{"4d4604fe7317a74f571ecddc48a3289100a714ce":1,"823239350a80f8df918ff4f94060c282f4c970dc":1},"m":51},{"id":"bsz_p3_52","t":"Hi IF and all,\n\nIn my scenario below. Its my understanding that we would not need to have TG1 at the kink associated with the 2DT because the PA suggests C would be hit before A is broken.\n\nWhen we are talking about taking about TG1 at the kink of the 2DT (double top) I am assuming we only do that when we do not have PA with an unmet TG.","a":"Edge","d":"09 Mar 2017 02:30","r":"","n":"#52","p":3,"im":["0c29d545cfd63d96484bd68f3159987dc5e64ecc"],"fa":"سلام IF و همه،\n\nدر سناریوی زیر، برداشتم این است که لازم نیست TG1 را روی پیچش مربوط به 2DT داشته باشیم، چون PA نشان می‌دهد C پیش از شکستن A زده می‌شود.\n\nوقتی از گرفتن TG1 روی پیچش 2DT (سقف دوقلو) حرف می‌زنیم، فرض من این است که این کار را فقط وقتی می‌کنیم که PA و TG پرنشده‌ای نداشته باشیم.","ib":{"0c29d545cfd63d96484bd68f3159987dc5e64ecc":3},"m":52},{"id":"bsz_p3_53","t":"","a":"linos","d":"09 Mar 2017 11:33","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#53","p":3,"im":["ae6f77a788f2de8d63feb0c89da82e15cf030aef"],"ib":{"ae6f77a788f2de8d63feb0c89da82e15cf030aef":0},"m":53},{"id":"bsz_p3_54","t":"Linos, zoom in 1m or 10s chart. can u help explain why it turned at the very little kink visible only in very low timeframe?","a":"staurum","d":"09 Mar 2017 12:06","r":"Master Trader","n":"#54","p":3,"im":[],"fa":"Linos، روی چارت 1 دقیقه یا 10 ثانیه زوم کن. می‌توانی کمک کنی توضیح بدهی چرا روی همان پیچش خیلی کوچکی که فقط در تایم‌چارچوب خیلی پایین دیده می‌شود چرخید؟","m":54},{"id":"bsz_p3_55","t":"Hey Staurum. equate this answer to a guess attempt. I am still not yet sure","a":"linos","d":"09 Mar 2017 15:38","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#55","p":3,"im":["3b21507151abe77277